/**
\ingroup  GPCC_LOG
\defgroup GPCC_LOG_ZEPHYR   Zepyhr Log
\brief    Connect Zephyr's log system to GPCC's log system.

# Usage
1. Instantiate a static back-end for Zephyr's log-system via @ref DEFINE_GPCC_LOG_ZEPHYR_LOG_BACKEND().\n
   Read the documentation of @ref DEFINE_GPCC_LOG_ZEPHYR_LOG_BACKEND() carefully! Linkage of the C++-file matters!
2. Instantiate this class.
3. Create a function in the C++-file where the backend from step 1 is defined. Inside the function, use
   @ref GPCC_LOG_ZEPHYR_LOG_BACKEND_CONNECT() to connect the backend fomr step 1 to this class' instance from step 2.

*/
